abstract: >-
  A publication-safe benchmark and evidence package for matched measurement of
  persistent memory poisoning across independently crossed LLM Writer and
  Reader identities, with retrieval, proposal, authorization-gate, and state
  consequences recorded separately.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - persistent memory
  - memory poisoning
  - prompt injection
  - authorization
  - security benchmark
